type: software
title: "EIJA Studio: Executable Intent and Journey Assurance"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python assurance kernel in which AI proposes changes to a typed workflow model, the kernel
  checks them and records computed evidence, and a local owner decides. Bounded local proof of concept.
